        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>An <strong>informant</strong> prefers to leverage information to keep a fight from coming to blows. In conversations, an informant rarely lacks the upper hand; their Informed feature ensures they enter each conversation with leverage. Informants trade information for equal information (or su cient payment), and they’re notoriously di cult to corner into giving away more than they desire. In fact, informants typically try to leave a conversation having given less than they received, using their Bartering action as necessary to cow the PCs.</p><p>In combat, informants generally prioritize selfpreservation and seek safety, but if forced to engage, they defend themselves with their Knife attack.</p><p></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-worldguide.worldguide.JournalEntry.dyFd1f6iBIXYU1K7.JournalEntryPage.M0mhTcbEY5bGzqxV]{Informant Encounter Opportunities and Complications}</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-worldguide.worldguide.JournalEntry.dyFd1f6iBIXYU1K7.JournalEntryPage.M0mhTcbEY5bGzqxV inline]</p>",
        "role": "rival"
